  "announcement_github_body": "## Release Notes\n\n\n\n## Install taskfleet 0.5.1\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/jarimustonen/orchestratectl/releases/download/v0.5.1/taskfleet-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install jarimustonen/taskfleet/taskfleet\n```\n\n## Download taskfleet 0.5.1\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [taskfleet-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jarimustonen/orchestratectl/releases/download/v0.5.1/taskfleet-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jarimustonen/orchestratectl/releases/download/v0.5.1/taskfleet-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [taskfleet-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/jarimustonen/orchestratectl/releases/download/v0.5.1/taskfleet-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/jarimustonen/orchestratectl/releases/download/v0.5.1/taskfleet-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [taskfleet-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/jarimustonen/orchestratectl/releases/download/v0.5.1/taskfleet-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/jarimustonen/orchestratectl/releases/download/v0.5.1/taskfleet-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n",
